 Experiment_Screenshot03.png", "id": "892172242606259", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974668_892172245939592_8316751272963261213_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JH1NZjzXk_QQ7kNvwH_kQ1b&_nc_oc=AdkzJGCb41deOP2l7yddM4PBQ3gEFlewdS4h-8ap1vEFeBhAKy_rVDlpe6-LPkmHIwI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4GM5fohKbRBGSYp3HYvot7286xN9PpebJt6KzHjMFsA&oe=699F0425"}, {"file_name": "Mixture And Compound Experiment_Screenshot04.png", "id": "917100010231111", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031466_917100013564444_3500690574673039206_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L4XjfWwLlz4Q7kNvwHLQh82&_nc_oc=Adml_OFTo9aHVUJTe7V8TjIIlOEbfxioIFeUwm7Lofu1xra1n0srmYxAxOUVx_FTddE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs4jEGDwUdrBeIgVrULWo8Cz8w80jRlbT1b3PFFtZetHg&oe=699EF1BE"}, {"file_name": "ApplicationFrameHost_EDSR4MrcxH.png", "id": "1194087315028195", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982451_1194087318361528_4605681021464602682_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H1QRIWBB6MYQ7kNvwGf7cla&_nc_oc=Admu50_yUWQ-vSvK5My4W645IMra4e93ipXlhjK7AnbdmjTqpuo2WGb_DKu0yXd5NnU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvI2LlleC9BnAlqtTlvJbmy9szpy18sLrrZGbeMmTEEFA&oe=699EF5C9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mixture And Compound_Landscape.png", "id": "768415761838438", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035383_768415765171771_2998842672286537959_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M89Y2BkidFkQ7kNvwFk6xWz&_nc_oc=AdlFJdK08wx_E4ulrJugn_rAa3DAaUezlgleQgpvZxkpUaiWtBtWp_t0hoTpXOgU8gE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftY0RecJmspbvqipN-bNVsFymFzUzVl-tDh0aXlfA0S-g&oe=699ED730"}, "display_name": "Mixture And Compound Experiment - ContentsDa Science Experiment", "keywords": ["experiment", "chemistry", "compound", "science", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. place a piece of parchment paper on the scale and tare it to zero.\nWeigh out 7 grams of sulfur powder\n2. add 7 g of sulfur to test tubes A and B.\n3. measure 4 g of iron powder and add it to test tubes A and B. \nAdd 11 g of only sulfur powder to C and 11 g of only iron powder to D.\n4. vigorously mix the iron and sulfur powder in test tubes A and B.\n5. heat test tube A with sulfur and iron powder with a blowtorch.\n6. Place a magnet on test tubes A through D and observe the results.\n7. move the test tubes A through D to the fume hood (a laboratory apparatus with ventilation holes).\n8. prepare the hydrochloric acid\n9. add hydrochloric acid to test tubes A through D\n10. add hydrochloric acid to test tubes A through D and observe\nStudents will learn about mixtures of iron and sulfur and how the compounds change.", "short_description": "Understand the difference between mixtures and compounds in this interactive experiment. It's a great way to learn about chemical bonding, molecular structures, and the properties that distinguish mixtures from pure substances."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tra